; The generator's eggs, zone 8 area 50 (Ryan, 2026-11-04: instead of carrying them to safety, the first one smashes and the mother turns on you, a mini boss; at half her health the two eggs left hatch, and her two babies fight beside her).
; Flags: stock 117, 118, 119 an egg gone (its decoration hidden at the load, its tube breakable: the item's condition, tested at a load only, so her end warps to the same room, a white blink), our 476 the fight begun, 478 the eggs hatched, 477 she is down.
; Records: 0 the mother standing, 1 the fight to half her health, 2 the rest of it, 3-5 a baby at each egg (spawned by TriggerMapEvent only).
; She ends the fight: babies still standing go with her, by the warp; a room left and entered again brings her back without them, so nothing can be left unfinished. Lines are Claude's drafts.

; an egg's A, as the map loads: while it is whole and the fight has not begun (the sequences check again: a trigger's condition is a load's)
script z8_egg_open1
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 117
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

script z8_egg_open2
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 118
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

script z8_egg_open3
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 119
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 476
        And
end

; her records, on a load during the fight (a player left the room and came back)
script z8_dino_first_half
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 478
        And
end

script z8_dino_second_half
        StackTestStoryFlag 478
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 477
        And
end

; one sequence an egg. Entry 0: once the fight has begun an egg does nothing (next index 5: the end)
sequence z8_egg1
  [0] script
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        JumpIfFalse free
        PushByte 5
        END
      free:
        PlayAudio 47
        SetStoryFlag 117
        FindEntityByType 7
        END
  [1] text 0 "@^You reach for the egg...\x0bIt slips, and smashes on the ground."
  [2] text 1 "#...Oops."
  [3] text 0 "@^The dinosaur beside the generator rears up.\x0bShe saw that.  She is NOT happy."
  [4] script -> 5
        SetStoryFlag 476
        WhiteFlash 20
        PlayAudio 60
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 245, 1
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 245, 50, 100
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

sequence z8_egg2
  [0] script
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        JumpIfFalse free
        PushByte 5
        END
      free:
        PlayAudio 47
        SetStoryFlag 118
        FindEntityByType 8
        END
  [1] text 0 "@^You reach for the egg...\x0bIt slips, and smashes on the ground."
  [2] text 1 "#...Oops."
  [3] text 0 "@^The dinosaur beside the generator rears up.\x0bShe saw that.  She is NOT happy."
  [4] script -> 5
        SetStoryFlag 476
        WhiteFlash 20
        PlayAudio 60
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 245, 1
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 245, 50, 100
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

sequence z8_egg3
  [0] script
        StackTestStoryFlag 476
        JumpIfFalse free
        PushByte 5
        END
      free:
        PlayAudio 47
        SetStoryFlag 119
        FindEntityByType 9
        END
  [1] text 0 "@^You reach for the egg...\x0bIt slips, and smashes on the ground."
  [2] text 1 "#...Oops."
  [3] text 0 "@^The dinosaur beside the generator rears up.\x0bShe saw that.  She is NOT happy."
  [4] script -> 5
        SetStoryFlag 476
        WhiteFlash 20
        PlayAudio 60
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 245, 1
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 245, 50, 100
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

; half her health: the first half's record falls; the eggs left hatch, and she stands again on the second half's
sequence z8_dino_hatch
  script
        PlayAudio 60
        WaitFrames 30
  text 0 "@^The dinosaur staggers...\x0bAnd behind her, the eggs begin to shake!"
  script
        SetStoryFlag 478
        WhiteFlash 20
        PlayAudio 47
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 117
        JumpIfFalse a
        FindEntityByType 7
        TriggerMapEvent 3
      a:
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 118
        JumpIfFalse b
        FindEntityByType 8
        TriggerMapEvent 4
      b:
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 119
        JumpIfFalse c
        FindEntityByType 9
        TriggerMapEvent 5
      c:
        SetStoryFlag 117
        SetStoryFlag 118
        SetStoryFlag 119
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 245, 2
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 245, 0, 50
  text 0 "@^CRACK!  Two babies burst from the shells, the image of their mother.\x0bAnd every bit as angry!"
  script
        SetActiveEntity 0
end

; the second half's record falls: she and her babies leave; the warp is what opens the tubes
sequence z8_dino_defeat
  script
        PlayAudio 60
        WaitFrames 40
        AddEXP 1500
        WaitFrames 30
  text 0 "@^The dinosaur crashes to the ground, then limps off into the hills, her babies at her heels.\x0bNothing guards the generator now."
  script
        SetStoryFlag 477
        FadeToWhite 10
        WarpToMapNoEntities 8, 50, 1, 288, 340
        FadeFromWhite 10
end
